//! The `grid-template-columns` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property
//! defines the line names and track sizing functions of the `grid columns`.
//!
//! Initial: none. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: refer to corresponding dimension of the content area.
//!
//! Grammar: none | <track-list> | <auto-track-list> | subgrid <line-name-list>?
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-grid-2/#propdef-grid-template-columns
//!
